        {"param": "m", "low": 2, "high": 8, "choices": null}
      ],
      "budget_share": 0.4,
      "why": "Registering every m stages cuts flip-flops and area versus the full pipeline while keeping 1 result/cycle, so it can dominate on area; I search m to find the area/latency sweet spot that still meets throughput and error."
    }
